DESCRIPTION:https://www.davidsongifted.org/gifted-programs/fellows-scholarship/\nU.S. citizens or Permanent Residents residing in the United States\, 18 or younger as of the application deadline\, who have completed a significant piece of work in one of eight categories (Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, Mathematics\, Literature\, Music\, Philosophy\, Outside the Box). Must be able to attend in-person awards reception in Washington\, D.C. in September with at least one parent/guardian.
